acked by pass status (with\noptional label overrides) or by study degree.","tree":{"sha":"7644c1e5bd5e9f66572acadcba42480cd8b12ee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/trees/7644c1e5bd5e9f66572acadcba42480cd8b12ee6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/commits/d3a625bbffda3e920fe49e5344a8c2ec91ded853","verification":{"payload":"tree 7644c1e5bd5e9f66572acadcba42480cd8b12ee6\nparent 7151d3ee2dcd8a5fdba5f31aa3cd74bec27c5e11\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791184666 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791184666 +0200\n\nAdd reusable statistics for course demographics (#288)\n\n* Add demographic grouping helpers for course statistics\n\nGroup participations by gender, study program, nationality (top 6 plus\nOther) and semester, with explicit Unknown groups for missing data, and\nturn the groups into stacked chart rows. getStatusString moves into its\nown module so the helpers stay free of JSX and run in the node tests.\n\n* Add DemographicDistributionCard\n\nA bar chart card for demographic groups. Bars show the group size with\nits share in the tooltip, and can be stacked by pass status (with\noptional label overrides) or by study degree.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw08aCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAARoQAFKJ11MdS2SGMCd7JYHOHsk7\nbj6Rs4Y5JDehi4SNJilXxZYlgQP9L+FSkCfZxrqTDIBcOranYRcEIyGgsO0fXLZQ\n9e9yxnd6Vhs6JRYnHsrdanRuAEcKqgUUnmQPg9eStwCF1KTY+0JzmWKmjxVuJn2h\nMSGHfRocL1S/g57d7UvedwykZxdUiJdJi87XbXSGmGk339StSaKnuQrWMJkmNHdb\nYVZIgCRFWZFc0yemAuUGcPE3k5UMsj+FoAw2L+BA/sD6Pm2Je7zJlYlF3bm2hqIV\nRjQ4NUrPUlR2SZBatoES2GalbC/mQWty3xEaE4nmAoH7m44mfyvCD+JwtxWh1aLX\naT8izKd/zFLIgEUJw918eWIeTsyz6wIMUO7r1zM8p1kwyp9KkRivhbLVeBN5U+XQ\nPl2RgRwmNNTeUD60VMBH+UxeR/ntjVyPAOFCoX25s7EfHNwJ1sFgzhWL9/7MwpVU\n3wr1c9XhTIJG/TRMreZcLUcQbytkmHgIKhbAw5A8hA8P6iQug7SadXwEFcPW7tOi\nKB/WkX010oLVz6tqfPq5JR5/XOc0ta1wukSmbLyl03Cx8czppr35/1sB6mkx7jRg\nh/Go5W7gmjF8ucN9XlVmLtyCqt