/users/magkue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/magkue","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commits/dad63c0e5b209731098e41850a0d79c368260b69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T17:07:53Z","email":"73171182+magkue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Magnus Kühne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T17:07:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show PROMPT profile pictures instead of Gravatar (#283)\n\n* Show PROMPT profile pictures instead of Gravatar\n\nProfilePicture looks the picture up by user, student, or course participation\nid through one batched request per render, loads only avatars near the\nviewport, and falls back to initials. The participants table gets a picture\ncolumn. getGravatarUrl keeps its signature but returns no URL, so no email\nhash leaves PROMPT. Refs prompt-edu/prompt#1945\n\n* Keep failed profile picture lookups apart from missing pictures\n\nA failed lookup now rejects and is retried once instead of being cached as\nno picture for 50 minutes. An empty src no longer hides a looked-up picture,\nand ProfilePictureProps is exported.\n\n* Name the picture column and render its cell with JSX\n\n* Skip the profile picture query with skipToken\n\nExport only profilePictureQueryKeys; the lookup hooks stay internal.\n\n* Stop exporting the profile picture batcher and drop the Gravatar test","tree":{"sha":"b1ffaa2340f94b45ca8eb384e318762f8b587c36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/trees/b1ffaa2340f94b45ca8eb384e318762f8b587c36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/commits/dad63c0e5b209731098e41850a0d79c368260b69","verification":{"payload":"tree b1ffaa2340f94b45ca8eb384e318762f8b587c36\nparent 41a6dcfdaae5abccf7137430bddeab615afa8a8e\nauthor Magnus Kühne <73171182+magkue@users.noreply.github.com> 1791047273 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791047273 +0200\n\nShow PROMPT profile pictures instead of Gravatar (#283)\n\n* Show PROMPT profile pictures instead of Gravatar\n\nProfilePicture looks the picture up by user, student, or course participation\nid through one batched request per render, loads only avatars near the\nviewport, and falls back to initials. The participants table gets a picture\ncolumn. getGravatarUrl keeps its signature but returns no URL, so no email\nhash leaves PROMPT. Refs prompt-edu/prompt#1945\n\n* Keep failed profile picture lookups apart from missing pictures\n\nA failed lookup now rejects and is retried once instead of being cached as\nno picture for 50 minutes. An empty src no longer hides a looked-up picture,\nand ProfilePictureProps is exported.\n\n* Name the picture column and render its cell with JSX\n\n* Skip the profile picture query with skipToken\n\nExport only profilePictureQueryKeys; the lookup hooks stay internal.\n\n* Stop exporting the profile picture batcher and drop the Gravatar test","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwTZpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAx3AQAJ5786KaDEHO9w6qKzGwdMUU\nWz2A+kzMuPsFFA4kaopqs/9gGZKS7FcOPfeRwLPQQLzCPg2JYuJRFTkbBONnYxKQ\nC97tShj2+kWC3eC4ZpqDmIJHIipb2dlL0qCvYwp2v4LKaEshyVLspMAhybAdTHzY\nMN+BwU0/EgOHIB/zJP8txQQN4pGc4mycW+LRiIHruzavjwctkx8JeouSTssq0Du1\nQj8cds0DMDyXxS1IkRo+HR6/nrdjG9prjngJiZrEPvPfQlclDUSTeQTBr1nH77fJ\nvwM9M0IBYEf4AQUIudbxPyhhFd5yBW71Zs/QRN2EvcJU2GWiJiQpOmcikDsMe+Xd\nhCMoUTBXIsPEjB6m2o6s8Gf4SFR6+IvdsIQgInigdME1MioKcO+y+Pd8r2ydKJ3v\n112Wg9vXUYkxbadfNJ/nnipB5EklkiQZnrOwHAsBlbvIbt/fDGgU+An4LDt43voq\nX38QK3SUnXARPGR8KVVOS5H8UZgdKQ1Z6TpGE7GOeP5hL02FfAtjKXBKlpT/4Vir\n91Ma6dCX7AchFt5LboIkgHCw+80n5pIbdn02edjT/qZMnjQ8BseP71YG16PNSxNZ\nWR8RyIFL8wynJl7NMBnry7PAgm/Y5YnUWMUrPTrKdU9QuwPO/CCOyf/lojX658ba\nzYlTdz9aCZij1ZdbhBFZ\n=qbk0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T17:07:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https:/