:"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commit/9a61f73f2d8224f0e393ddb5da65fcebdec371b4","sha":"9a61f73f2d8224f0e393ddb5da65fcebdec371b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commits/9a61f73f2d8224f0e393ddb5da65fcebdec371b4"}],"sha":"b7fdf6537ef9a385cc5a339bd04b1ad643649c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commits/b7fdf6537ef9a385cc5a339bd04b1ad643649c4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53191688?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commits/9a61f73f2d8224f0e393ddb5da65fcebdec371b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:07:31Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:07:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Lint in CI and build on pushes to main (#273)\n\n* Sort the lib barrel exports so biome check passes\n\nThe single error biome check reports on main: assist/source/organizeImports\nwants getStudentName after getStatusBadge and getStatusColor. Applying it is\nwhat lets the new CI lint step be green from the first run.\n\n* Lint in CI and run the package workflow on pushes to main\n\nThe workflow was the only check a pull request got and it ran the build alone,\nso biome never ran anywhere but on a contributor''s machine. It also triggered on\npull requests only, and a pull request run builds the PR head merged with main\nas it was at the time: two individually green pull requests can land a main that\nnothing ever built, and the next signal would be the publish job, which builds\nafter the tag and the release already exist.\n\nAdds a lint step running `yarn biome check` over the package, matching what\nprompt''s quality-clients workflow runs per client module, and a `push: main`\ntrigger with a concurrency group so a merge run cancels the pull request run it\nsupersedes. No separate typecheck step: `yarn build` is `tsc --project` plus\n`tsc-alias`, so it already typechecks all of `src`.\n\nThe workflow and its job are renamed, since neither only builds any more. That\nchanges the check name from `build` to `quality-package`; main''s ruleset\nrequires no status checks by name, so nothing depends on the old one.\n\nCloses #271\nCloses #272","tree":{"sha":"74ea65e8ae083c8098d186e6ac0ba8c9756ab2a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/trees/74ea65e8ae083c8098d186e6ac0ba8c9756ab2a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/commits/9a61f73f2d8224f0e393ddb5da65fcebdec371b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 74ea65e8ae083c8098d186e6ac0ba8c9756ab2a2\nparent 3741ec5dc4fa9b5df031c5703b5c549533f84e41\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1789038451 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789038451 +0100\n\nLint in CI and build on pushes to main (#273)\n\n* Sort the lib barrel exports so biome check passes\n\nThe single error biome check reports on main: assist/source/organizeImports\nwants getStudentName after getStatusBadge and getStatusColor. Applying it is\nwhat lets the new CI lint step be green from the first run.\n\n* Lint in CI and run the package workflow on pushes to main\n\nThe workflow was the only check a pull request got and it ran the build alone,\nso biome never ran anywhere but on a contributor''s machine. It also triggered on\npull requests only, and a pull request run builds the PR head merged with main\nas it was at the time: two individually green pull requests can land a main that\nnothing ever built, and the next signal would be the publish job, which builds\nafter the tag and the release already exist.\n\nAdds a lint step running `yarn biome check` over the package, matching what\nprompt''s quality-clients workflow runs per client module, and a `push: main`\ntrigger with a concurrency group so a merge run cancels the pull request run it\nsupersedes. No separate typecheck step: `yarn build` is `tsc --project` plus\n`tsc-alias`, so it already typechecks all of `src`.\n\nThe workflow and its job are renamed, since neither only builds any more. That\nchanges the check name from `build` to `quality-package`; main''s ruleset\nrequires no status checks by name, so nothing depends on the old one.\n\nCloses #271\nCloses #272","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoo9zCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQtsQABwvtygF5f2ugkdJRpkdNA7C\nK6C73RX1JJqySTyRqvlZiC3KLcUsghwGmvaW5SyMbrV/ftlLcnx6/bhIsqutWKIg\necuZi7oOxFvf9IqGXRsKBhp56qvCEXmLn8eaxgR9BZsAj7fq3CA+gnXChkIb6VXW\nVNHrYGgq3pMA6WnuYZM00I9grZ/96IgIEkd0U741di2UJwmXdmKv7Nw0Pp4Bnws7\ngBwq0dA25Z0spdXgcuUv1UgjGQHecHVmhwmzPQOmL+suNVwSQc1pvNdm0gqwMAAa\ngYsk6S5kowPOcRHn0M+x0xVxs7iH41SeuKYgMamodsg3VcijAuj4rqDNb6a15xGD\nC+xNdX035mCeVtQD9x07OBOpEQt9rg7S+rsfHiDRqt9XT9vaAB11SjJyzWkdxhJK\nL/J++N9T578h/pNEz5RrvTirMX2tLzCHwdkyquLbnQrl8yE41Eb62YHhZFQRmkEM\nqTubaU6MdVuN5YMDJbGzrVwIy0QtWj5FB0bbSvlCe44uCgFDOnFSumbio6QORmg7\nsZemgtlDOCnc8e6nk+Hk8Qj2fkQTkP43wh9VPf1Dowmy9U4jsNnaMbWZFH3msHqv\nS3xbsBOhjyHBY2MBAHXz560n5cVacl0dRhns3HqU+IFcgPV2u4BVaa+rjIgHNr8s\nlir2aIcJIWglEKH2yveH\n=+dtO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----