"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commits/39d4df53c86098e3e3410a2b772c1ae898f7885a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T14:55:56Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T14:55:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix package build by deduplicating tiptap and prosemirror (#250)\n\nThe build failed with ~70 TypeScript errors because two copies of\n@tiptap/core were installed: the direct dependencies pinned 3.29.2 while\ntransitive `^3.29.2` ranges (starter-kit, react and their extensions)\nresolved to 3.30.0. Module augmentations such as `toggleBold` landed on\none copy while the editor types came from the other, so commands looked\nmissing and structurally identical extension types were rejected.\nprosemirror-model was duplicated the same way (1.25.4 and 1.25.11).\n\n- Align all @tiptap/* pins on 3.30.0 so transitive ranges resolve to a\n  single copy\n- Dedupe prosemirror-* in the lockfile onto 1.25.11\n- Add the options 3.30.0 made required: exitOnArrowUp on the code block\n  and markdownLinks on the link extension, both set to the upstream\n  defaults","tree":{"sha":"75836f2c8339775d550a8c2971c0d5aa786dedb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/trees/75836f2c8339775d550a8c2971c0d5aa786dedb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/commits/39d4df53c86098e3e3410a2b772c1ae898f7885a","verification":{"payload":"tree 75836f2c8339775d550a8c2971c0d5aa786dedb6\nparent b2870fb55859a6b921c1d616ae3939d9056fc79d\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1786546556 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786546556 +0200\n\nFix package build by deduplicating tiptap and prosemirror (#250)\n\nThe build failed with ~70 TypeScript errors because two copies of\n@tiptap/core were installed: the direct dependencies pinned 3.29.2 while\ntransitive `^3.29.2` ranges (starter-kit, react and their extensions)\nresolved to 3.30.0. Module augmentations such as `toggleBold` landed on\none copy while the editor types came from the other, so commands looked\nmissing and structurally identical extension types were rejected.\nprosemirror-model was duplicated the same way (1.25.4 and 1.25.11).\n\n- Align all @tiptap/* pins on 3.30.0 so transitive ranges resolve to a\n  single copy\n- Dedupe prosemirror-* in the lockfile onto 1.25.11\n- Add the options 3.30.0 made required: exitOnArrowUp on the code block\n  and markdownLinks on the link extension, both set to the upstream\n  defaults","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfIl8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjbgQAB0wPSFvEEca59MLfflfoUQ5\ng/4H6bmKQs9OdG1Ed0x5zseB0evS/Yt9cnoeD/koZEUGH+JeFebU5lZ5AquS4SO1\nUDqkgWq/1Jk36uyVfQZoQDPK9elLLR5elc100Z7cN9w42wr1hq9RHar/j18t6qJM\nYFFgDeLudFFljo0PoMiV/3+9Ns2AmtmV/wcgT8XtWGaQ90lcpr08ojYP9lzV9Hwq\nbPgMJfLbLNpoL8A73R+VNTiYs6MQD4ADLNxW2v3KqAUNxC3tK417jJ3ZHju1ixa3\njgwhFfERvv7K0dYX/I3266HYhwn8AFRVIxAaFO35x2RGg9f4X/rGX3vkYjV2qwjU\neWCID/3YSfDsU4jCSWIGTMoBMPqxCKD0Hti5mZurCjZt5frVyvFU1P6qRv9Zgre0\n3yWEJOb/e8f8w+9EUznwT8461H+agrHVuoNDGL2/GKlaTSbnATPbeWqT0hoUBw7h\nn7HczaglMHXKHMyZWncY+oO6hOObpPnmg5FPOwo8PlpdIJAjYCtjPYJf7OI4r3bx\nzn0xCNY0qhLUvPX746WWLc1o1iYwHrYauEb7mho1iH3b0hp5waOgUX/+9u4NtJnz\nKBL4hR2rLGOtSQeJoSAqMtPuPGEGukxkrPEuuUmWteFe2JFpoT4NXOhv7XZ81YJy\ni9nogNW2Ij3WrkLz1gSM\n=D1fc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-12T14:56:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events