----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-23T08:23:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commit/405d6f1f7b012a071549334985ec3d53688fd5aa","node_id":"C_kwDONqH1h9oAKDQwNWQ2ZjFmN2IwMTJhMDcxNTQ5MzM0OTg1ZWMzZDUzNjg4ZmQ1YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commit/edd1b250a7bc4beb927666c87737268ad3745991","sha":"edd1b250a7bc4beb927666c87737268ad3745991","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commits/edd1b250a7bc4beb927666c87737268ad3745991"}],"sha":"405d6f1f7b012a071549334985ec3d53688fd5aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commits/405d6f1f7b012a071549334985ec3d53688fd5aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1272922?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mtze","id":1272922,"login":"Mtze","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzI5MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mtze","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/commits/edd1b250a7bc4beb927666c87737268ad3745991/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T08:23:05Z","email":"github@linhuber.org","name":"Matthias Linhuber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T08:23:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix duplicate autolink plugin in MinimalTiptap editor (#201)\n\nThe minimal-tiptap component crashed with `RangeError: Adding different\ninstances of a keyed plugin (autolink$1)` when the editor was mounted.\n\nIn Tiptap v3 `StarterKit` includes the `Link` extension by default. The\nhook also pushed a custom `Link` (extending `TiptapLink`) on top, so both\nregistered the keyed `autolink` ProseMirror plugin and the second one\nthrew.\n\nDisable the bundled Link via `StarterKit.configure({ link: false })` so\nonly the custom Link extension registers. The custom extension still\ninherits autolink behavior through `...(this.parent?.() || [])` in its\n`addProseMirrorPlugins`, so nothing is lost.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"850e9bc5b7ac7bc56eb118555639aef6baa86b46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/trees/850e9bc5b7ac7bc56eb118555639aef6baa86b46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-lib/git/commits/edd1b250a7bc4beb927666c87737268ad3745991","verification":{"payload":"tree 850e9bc5b7ac7bc56eb118555639aef6baa86b46\nparent f283986a192a0589cbb34b764e38961934604b00\nauthor Matthias Linhuber <github@linhuber.org> 1782202985 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782202985 +0200\n\nFix duplicate autolink plugin in MinimalTiptap editor (#201)\n\nThe minimal-tiptap component crashed with `RangeError: Adding different\ninstances of a keyed plugin (autolink$1)` when the editor was mounted.\n\nIn Tiptap v3 `StarterKit` includes the `Link` extension by default. The\nhook also pushed a custom `Link` (extending `TiptapLink`) on top, so both\nregistered the keyed `autolink` ProseMirror plugin and the second one\nthrew.\n\nDisable the bundled Link via `StarterKit.configure({ link: false })` so\nonly the custom Link extension registers. The custom extension still\ninherits autolink behavior through `...(this.parent?.() || [])` in its\n`addProseMirrorPlugins`, so nothing is lost.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOkJpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3dgQAFzJudXP42MKl+GJWy2bw3fA\nyxpcw438IdNcqAWu76uREeUfOJN/jjS3GRptwiT7/UVpIw9RBtztt4rF2emt4Toj\nOqFgsRXsqEazVCfrMcYtwyjmdASG35YFmyuVXTfPvYIweBTjN64JbfMR0dYZhN+G\nQaferfDDfb0XBg/fQDBJuvplfoekoT7T5bLBOP+9Ui3skVIqWcO77gknTOAeO9Or\nBbfdm7TcA/tDEfs4DY9AWncoVD++B3eXMPT6cAaQZgdPzu6K0NGM8NdAJvtj7FZq\nbe/L6BvBv3PcgqeSBnyWXAQ3AWdUxdn6dOCoIngI/S/FaPPHD33H+P5ApXR17nxW\n4p4yjzpLiC8lXXXdXdOO90IdyxUXLou2r9a0YV7J6ha6fGXaduzvAGi1iMPXPwFG\nG3HKOy7a35XtR0hEAtxEqKf88Nzt7KP8potSEaZCXxJ5iayinL3mZJulA1m+9FU4\nURDkZXzbXkRJWhJGrAa9ihG0NdE7JHEEbm3qKuMLrF2Rs102Q6nkUn28npsUOv5U\nUXLADIQiEepkR4ocPVT9ickoHhK3IjWa8Mee11lSxd/Z8pt7hEj/XF+I87cs8dMi\nCw84HXaSZdV4n0q+Osdx0vMx56reOrb8GGUcqrARbEaxIGg1uP92RvQWwVytdm4Z\nyNSyuvHqIU/ZaeWK8Fem\n=ia/J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-23T08:23:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow