nts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/runeb","id":38528,"login":"runeb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runeb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/2d8c511936532b2cd9dfe9700afaa8a424785136/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:30:29Z","email":"rbotten@gmail.com","name":"Rune Botten"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:30:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(cli): speed up startup by deferring heavy imports (#1929)\n\n* perf(cli): defer heavy imports on the startup path\n\nThe update-check init hook imported the @sanity/cli-core barrel on every\ninvocation, which statically pulled in jsdom (~600 modules), rxjs and\n@sanity/client. `sanity --version` loaded ~1,950 files and took ~430ms.\n\n- lazy-load jsdom browser stubs inside setupBrowserStubs\n- lazy-load rxjs and the empty-auth client in getStudioWorkspaces\n- import update-check helpers from light cli-core subpaths\n- lazy-load the update notification (only needed when an update exists)\n\n`sanity --version` / `--help` drop from ~430ms to ~160ms locally, and\ncommands that load the barrel (e.g. `telemetry status`) from ~550ms to\n~320ms.\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1929\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"42b0feba66058f1f1fd9a301aa30c3ba31d75d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/trees/42b0feba66058f1f1fd9a301aa30c3ba31d75d07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/commits/2d8c511936532b2cd9dfe9700afaa8a424785136","verification":{"payload":"tree 42b0feba66058f1f1fd9a301aa30c3ba31d75d07\nparent 8484fa6908ac4bd13066ec6c1fbe0ebc32aed488\nauthor Rune Botten <rbotten@gmail.com> 1790713829 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790713829 -0700\n\nperf(cli): speed up startup by deferring heavy imports (#1929)\n\n* perf(cli): defer heavy imports on the startup path\n\nThe update-check init hook imported the @sanity/cli-core barrel on every\ninvocation, which statically pulled in jsdom (~600 modules), rxjs and\n@sanity/client. `sanity --version` loaded ~1,950 files and took ~430ms.\n\n- lazy-load jsdom browser stubs inside setupBrowserStubs\n- lazy-load rxjs and the empty-auth client in getStudioWorkspaces\n- import update-check helpers from light cli-core subpaths\n- lazy-load the update notification (only needed when an update exists)\n\n`sanity --version` / `--help` drop from ~430ms to ~160ms locally, and\ncommands that load the barrel (e.g. `telemetry status`) from ~550ms to\n~320ms.\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1929\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvB/lCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlM8QAGoWnRqrNsJm+hPMEwC7iq/u\nM4yDaExEWAymtJB49Lv2YkrQrOgsDMhSkqh9Rnqf1I8e5RV4Y6x4OSIp82sN1Gd5\naQ3bNBtZ9OhAmXnidRW1zkYJkxuWBKPH4s5ALlGqHmm9to12KUDsTXltviNXSl4x\nHvrQpRTDdhaUk/YJE1fpO+WbJj9SGLE0cdPt2k39zj4ZTM4pIXIMOxPDMWsXPi7i\nN2MQ0v6XBB7a1PdvDfmJOwPGEyhcBoT4xHn2myZtKju5fqVE4hTkfKIVt7ggO9Ez\n0lGyvROf9Bx8piqvMzcvKCGzfJl8JRE2rz1v6QWQ5sTZlS86BetmmXif8HdYQ0JK\noayDMmk7KdRiXPR7PUf8j201vVLDlUNY8QKl1bGcNiYIodgWQ