4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gu-stav","id":2244375,"login":"gu-stav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDQzNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/8484fa6908ac4bd13066ec6c1fbe0ebc32aed488/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:06:27Z","email":"gu@stav.dev","name":"Gustav Hansen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:06:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(workbench-cli): wait for the shell''s bound port before printing it (#1927)\n\n* fix(workbench-cli): wait for the shell''s bound port before printing it\n\nworkbench.lock holds the requested port until the shell is listening. A\n`sanity dev` that read the lock in that window printed a Workbench URL for\nwhatever else held the requested port. The lock now carries a ready flag and\nreaders wait for it.\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1927\n\n* fix(workbench-cli): poll the lock without liveness checks or pruning\n\nEach poll spawned ps/PowerShell through readWorkbenchLock and could prune the\nempty file updatePort leaves mid-write, deleting the live lock.\n\n* refactor(workbench-cli): share the lock file read and log a lock that never gets ready\n\n* refactor(workbench-cli): only guard JSON.parse when reading the lock\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"73d8f5d5b2fdc65a1e0ef9596aa364b5d51f209f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/trees/73d8f5d5b2fdc65a1e0ef9596aa364b5d51f209f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/commits/8484fa6908ac4bd13066ec6c1fbe0ebc32aed488","verification":{"payload":"tree 73d8f5d5b2fdc65a1e0ef9596aa364b5d51f209f\nparent eef2e391247b8c19b16cfbb03b23c23367a42c59\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gu@stav.dev> 1790697987 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790697987 +0200\n\nfix(workbench-cli): wait for the shell''s bound port before printing it (#1927)\n\n* fix(workbench-cli): wait for the shell''s bound port before printing it\n\nworkbench.lock holds the requested port until the shell is listening. A\n`sanity dev` that read the lock in that window printed a Workbench URL for\nwhatever else held the requested port. The lock now carries a ready flag and\nreaders wait for it.\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1927\n\n* fix(workbench-cli): poll the lock without liveness checks or pruning\n\nEach poll spawned ps/PowerShell through readWorkbenchLock and could prune the\nempty file updatePort leaves mid-write, deleting the live lock.\n\n* refactor(workbench-cli): share the lock file read and log a lock that never gets ready\n\n* refactor(workbench-cli): only guard JSON.parse when reading the lock\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu+IDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8/MQAC5nJYh3W9gVBr0NV58Xbr28\nhDOPy6Ry9J+PNMy6gKsUDHZjUDMYu5kwnfh4gu3JUW3LfIQrObqzlo3A2p03rpLl\n3g0B2cqxkuZq425gjAQqKYONIbH9jUJFfZuCXLjrGkL7j/xxSti+tfJ26h6CZd3i\nsvx3aDpNX+RwOVvHZOu51H6gCh7+2Wj5oKR63rYgecH87ey9Vp2WKA814T8FSs/C\n1gnHFxXFEqNw9dKOvr1Ejw4aO/h7fTsvUMZdEExjJF4WJ8BuYaQmN2ZJGvfJGMFK\nlX47