908ac4bd13066ec6c1fbe0ebc32aed488"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2244375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gu-stav","id":2244375,"login":"gu-stav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDQzNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/eef2e391247b8c19b16cfbb03b23c23367a42c59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:19:05Z","email":"gu@stav.dev","name":"Gustav Hansen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:19:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(workbench-cli): start the shell when the workbench remote runs first (#1926)\n\n* fix(workbench-cli): start the shell when the workbench remote runs first\n\nThe workbench remote took workbench.lock with its own port, so a Studio or\napp started afterwards skipped the shell and printed the remote''s URL, which\nrenders blank. The remote now runs as a plain app server and leaves the lock\nto the shell. Its registry bridge had no consumer and is gone too.\n\nFixes SDK-2753\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1926\n\n* fix(workbench-cli): only drop the remote''s lock claim\n\nKeep startWorkbenchRemoteCoordinator and its registry bridge so the fix stays\nscoped to the lock.\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1926\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ca361295096625d363d2c29b7412b24b1093931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/trees/9ca361295096625d363d2c29b7412b24b1093931"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/commits/eef2e391247b8c19b16cfbb03b23c23367a42c59","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ca361295096625d363d2c29b7412b24b1093931\nparent d3ef75be4c000a1f6de496e05e5c75c35fbe4aad\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gu@stav.dev> 1790666345 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790666345 +0200\n\nfix(workbench-cli): start the shell when the workbench remote runs first (#1926)\n\n* fix(workbench-cli): start the shell when the workbench remote runs first\n\nThe workbench remote took workbench.lock with its own port, so a Studio or\napp started afterwards skipped the shell and printed the remote''s URL, which\nrenders blank. The remote now runs as a plain app server and leaves the lock\nto the shell. Its registry bridge had no consumer and is gone too.\n\nFixes SDK-2753\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1926\n\n* fix(workbench-cli): only drop the remote''s lock claim\n\nKeep startWorkbenchRemoteCoordinator and its registry bridge so the fix stays\nscoped to the lock.\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1926\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu2ZpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA86oQABYouzpuvPu8hqrmNwIrBYQx\nDu25Jflx3oq71jXQgC2muxLtneT2tZ0DyquGjP1PsgS76gc4qwt9Nx/w7jipJC+g\nlZNJrr44iS+CehBL5aiQLOE3wsI7nYYUM5P0NGNPVdyonQRWNfh2lkFAJfitlMVB\njdhFVjQVioA1q3X/IOzuq3yQSM0EvJl5fIsintQ16Gzctx2JHfk63zl4qbTN+Kf3\njXaBKlO93K00zzw8/l4jUtBWlI9IJWlBX2aMOxNCT75p0HaxKx7T557XBS97PQHU\ncPola81ICkH0WkRGs69FrkkuS5vl6ZylCN4KVv1tP3aOJnjKgX6bJownjv8RkJF3\n5lNll2ncGYPpUU7l1