rated entries (#1925)\n\n* fix(cli): import the user config before sanity in generated entries\n\nreact-dom reads the DevTools hook once at module init, so a side-effect\nimport at the top of sanity.config.ts or the app entry only runs first if\nthe generated entry requests that module before sanity / react-dom/client.\nApplies to the studio and app bootstrap and the workbench remote entry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cody Olsen <stipsan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1925\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1925\n\n* fix(cli): keep the entry import reorder in cli-build only\n\nDrop the workbench federation remote change. The generated studio and app\nentries in @sanity/cli-build still import the user module before sanity\nand react-dom.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cody Olsen <stipsan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1925\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1925\n\n* chore: hand-write the cli-build release note\n\nDrop the auto-generated marker so CI leaves this changeset in place.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cody Olsen <stipsan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cody Olsen <stipsan@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"caacd5718623959a3f114e9ed4ed881db0cd2b92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/trees/caacd5718623959a3f114e9ed4ed881db0cd2b92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/commits/bc6179121f478f74b756d75e79b68e027dd06193","verification":{"payload":"tree caacd5718623959a3f114e9ed4ed881db0cd2b92\nparent 889389af0dd18225961e0659ceca82ff4b0c6a8f\nauthor Cody Olsen <81981+stipsan@users.noreply.github.com> 1790638834 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790638834 +0000\n\nfix(cli): import the studio config before sanity in generated entries (#1925)\n\n* fix(cli): import the user config before sanity in generated entries\n\nreact-dom reads the DevTools hook once at module init, so a side-effect\nimport at the top of sanity.config.ts or the app entry only runs first if\nthe generated entry requests that module before sanity / react-dom/client.\nApplies to the studio and app bootstrap and the workbench remote entry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cody Olsen <stipsan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1925\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1925\n\n* fix(cli): keep the entry import reorder in cli-build only\n\nDrop the workbench federation remote change. The generated studio and app\nentries in @sanity/cli-build still import the user module before sanity\nand react-dom.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cody Olsen <stipsan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1925\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1925\n\n* chore: hand-write the cli-build release note\n\nDrop the auto-generated marker so CI leaves this changeset in place.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cody Olsen <stipsan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cody Olsen <stipsan@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquvryCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjx8QAEj52pUE/mBQF3F9/+kKnyIY\nyv92hZsS/+qQLOFAhynomer93wmUZRH0R5S7ijfwYM5JkfPtd4ME3EQJvCqndR+V\nbVwhNyEXb1c+Ih51niIckoSsirML3rNd1aNKmlNLpEUss1SyBPlFbYqYtM380JAy\nKX7Z2DylI5ehHhtAXvAFnnggXQEh382rekgPqT0f/obRG8kmMPtwMZeMqApu+s6j\nFCLBsK4QC3eyQaJZOcKUBUJ+gRUrgq0DauqUN07SzURTzBbuNQph39zaJlPWvTnX\n15BSevp/iOh2QZD106E5gg+GV3uFFARkuBUGyyL5KqKZ95hOetFigeAEkZQR0SQ+\nf6KQrRpaaXbMk0FwygBRV+x4ZAqw9Ztc5Dx2wWQusFHxzvAhOv2eBuMPLHGhBN8m\n84rjJQSM8ciuDXvNQkiqrZQ3fCYOZ/IIRJh0aAdPDr8FU82QAOUgJEOU54tFtLLD\nxgb9Vgk62SH8MG9Okqjju3G0VIIwPlZFQvlLI/mWfMF