9ceca82ff4b0c6a8f","node_id":"C_kwDONqSnoNoAKDg4OTM4OWFmMGRkMTgyMjU5NjFlMDY1OWNlY2E4MmZmNGIwYzZhOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sanity-io/cli/commit/33db2b808e2b7371f360f063a2450caa31f34fb8","sha":"33db2b808e2b7371f360f063a2450caa31f34fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/33db2b808e2b7371f360f063a2450caa31f34fb8"}],"sha":"889389af0dd18225961e0659ceca82ff4b0c6a8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/889389af0dd18225961e0659ceca82ff4b0c6a8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2244375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gu-stav","id":2244375,"login":"gu-stav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDQzNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/33db2b808e2b7371f360f063a2450caa31f34fb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:15:44Z","email":"gu@stav.dev","name":"Gustav Hansen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:15:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(workbench-cli): share shell dependencies with federated apps (#1917)\n\n* feat(workbench-cli): share shell dependencies with federated apps\n\nThe standalone workbench shell never initializes a federation container:\neach federated app downloads its own copies of React, React DOM and\nstyled-components.\n\nExpose the shell''s copies through virtual:sanity/federation-host using the\nsame pools and exact versions as the app build. This keeps the sharing\ncontract in the CLI instead of duplicating it in the shell.\n\n* test(workbench-cli): verify federation host sharing at runtime\n\nThe federation host test compared generated code byte for byte, so\nharmless formatting edits broke it, while a missing lib thunk (a real\nruntime failure) surfaced only as a vague string mismatch. The\nintegration test missed that failure entirely.\n\nEvaluate the generated module and assert that an app joining the host\npool takes the host copy. Check that every discovered pool reaches the\nwritten standalone output, so the tests guard the contract Module\nFederation consumes.\n\n* refactor(workbench-cli): expose federation host state directly\n\nThe host api guards a single mutable field, so the closure and accessors\nadded indirection with no invariant to enforce. Keeping module\ngeneration private makes the plugin the single entry point, and the test\nhelper now describes the provider shape the tests read.","tree":{"sha":"d31d5efdfec44f7ea27c73c127c8d1c01cf1e891","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/trees/d31d5efdfec44f7ea27c73c127c8d1c01cf1e891"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/commits/33db2b808e2b7371f360f063a2450caa31f34fb8","verification":{"payload":"tree d31d5efdfec44f7ea27c73c127c8d1c01cf1e891\nparent 65f617f6d0b8af5aa160877db6150b366801cb47\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gu@stav.dev> 1790237744 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790237744 +0200\n\nfeat(workbench-cli): share shell dependencies with federated apps (#1917)\n\n* feat(workbench-cli): share shell dependencies with federated apps\n\nThe standalone workbench shell never initializes a federation container:\neach federated app downloads its own copies of React, React DOM and\nstyled-components.\n\nExpose the shell''s copies through virtual:sanity/federation-host using the\nsame pools and exact versions as the app build. This keeps the sharing\ncontract in the CLI instead of duplicating it in the shell.\n\n* test(workbench-cli): verify federation host sharing at runtime\n\nThe federation host test compared generated code byte for byte, so\nharmless formatting edits broke it, while a missing lib thunk (a real\nruntime failure) surfaced only as a vague string mismatch. The\nintegration test missed that failure entirely.\n\nEvaluate the generated module and assert that an app joining the host\npool takes the host copy. Check that every discovered pool reaches the\nwritten standalone output, so the tests guard the contract Module\nFederation consumes.\n\n* refactor(workbench-cli): expose federation host state directly\n\nThe host api guards a single mutable field, so the closure and accessors\nadded indirection with no invariant to enforce. Keeping module\ngeneration private makes the plugin the single entry point, and the test\nhelper now describes the provider shape the tests read.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtNwwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJJEQACrH9C54Y0k6K1WkOXRmIQDo\ng/a7wiRa22vN2X8al1oBjMhweeW4rQVlC9MwReN+8j3z6L5dW6KdYpaVJfNYVAwh\nGC8Q+V8ChdZ4tUdC/rGEc06EpuXwNjeXBo4GowBTqQ4kyJMw+iwQOXHBY4Z+lobv\nMyyQHwiyGW7tMeQoeq8NMW2tRdH1AuqVSwfB+sLNw+GNTf8k7+2vAjWTyzn82QxC\nx1T5sjPuBw8i0AHEpxaRzgLOBQAcEHhnM9KC7LSiggYkNG60yAWRhaW12pEJXzQX\n7vaeoG4PtKXsgAXqhGtTHcPtqCgQTCrntOwfKJHYYCruXs9N2xpcAI23PMTAWKPB\nCKjmNrBC7QYIvt4iMGwGvtHoxAbkadLxodVtT3Zhby3MubLu3jAiyUxAl3S9/pqo\nx3SxVCBokhwYAlSLkgSsIYd4fsWo7E4IJP//t5lphJxOHqN/HnTfPej/tYE68jNQ\nXH1Hg9sUUk/cdn9xbJtWQhxFx0oYRJxIFMlNk3yvpkSK4g8J+9CdnKe7nwdgplWf\nVYNggSDiPhIUfQY4sNUvDNP9o3KPqcUmwTqOJ5uSbiE7dl4x7yUIk24iAIABTfCZ\nrQY9a0nQB6P1htNqvTMVaKnZHywdKOvpbwO8p35hRRv/waM/qUBCASoadW2tCfwv\nxjS9teQJpiH6mkgfrovh\n=SsQW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T08:15:4