tml_url":"https://github.com/sanity-io/cli/commit/c6290b75b8aed3d4524c419e63d762769f45c90a","node_id":"C_kwDONqSnoNoAKGM2MjkwYjc1YjhhZWQzZDQ1MjRjNDE5ZTYzZDc2Mjc2OWY0NWM5MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sanity-io/cli/commit/f15ca8abb61add4329ecd1b2e9b125ac0bc2040d","sha":"f15ca8abb61add4329ecd1b2e9b125ac0bc2040d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/f15ca8abb61add4329ecd1b2e9b125ac0bc2040d"}],"sha":"c6290b75b8aed3d4524c419e63d762769f45c90a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/c6290b75b8aed3d4524c419e63d762769f45c90a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2244375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gu-stav","id":2244375,"login":"gu-stav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDQzNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/commits/f15ca8abb61add4329ecd1b2e9b125ac0bc2040d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T15:11:21Z","email":"gu@stav.dev","name":"Gustav Hansen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T15:11:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(workbench-cli): let `sanity start` use the workbench remote override (#1908)\n\n`sanity start` ignored `SANITY_INTERNAL_WORKBENCH_REMOTE_URL` so a\n`.env.development` pointing at a dev server could not break a production\npreview. That also blocked pointing a preview shell at a locally built remote,\nwhich is what measuring a remote''s download size needs.\n\nHonouring the variable removes the `mode` that was threaded through two\ninterfaces to reach this one branch. Set no variable to keep loading the\ndeployed UI.","tree":{"sha":"d29f4e39892cb9d399c19978023b9f9eb2a75cb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/trees/d29f4e39892cb9d399c19978023b9f9eb2a75cb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/commits/f15ca8abb61add4329ecd1b2e9b125ac0bc2040d","verification":{"payload":"tree d29f4e39892cb9d399c19978023b9f9eb2a75cb0\nparent 9ac2c752d97d4e3a59c9a30ca6455bbc47177464\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gu@stav.dev> 1790003481 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790003481 +0200\n\nfix(workbench-cli): let `sanity start` use the workbench remote override (#1908)\n\n`sanity start` ignored `SANITY_INTERNAL_WORKBENCH_REMOTE_URL` so a\n`.env.development` pointing at a dev server could not break a production\npreview. That also blocked pointing a preview shell at a locally built remote,\nwhich is what measuring a remote''s download size needs.\n\nHonouring the variable removes the `mode` that was threaded through two\ninterfaces to reach this one branch. Set no variable to keep loading the\ndeployed UI.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsUkZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+O0QAFff1mtDqZwUiu11mT/OspyH\nukEfAvdlumP0u/Bu4hd17J4OSFITW7lXllc7kfQTTYzP3zfOJJUl/aCHVazuYAF+\nf5pY5F83hbhuLk1JM6aVyscnHFD/O7fe4pAl1Erbn6blZPjLCtmgKSgtB182wfoc\njIkAatjXudgbZCkcbQhG334aq3i1Gx+VfhHSbxW5lhpoeq5ecT2OUdCCFKtP5Leb\nKJ4EfwELHG7bwwC6K5eGBRlbO29YILppo7k/fRjEThXxuDzsxxpRqXDtGDm8QpPX\nHSsOAMsWwCbTjtsPk9ti6jfzePs+lti4KrH6yxQ4pi60LxT8wF7RDvDFGEtwcyta\nAQUQ/dEl3qM0lAkBjH9/zPz4MpuyURzM4ILNMoVkLLV1/4nrWDo0pLxui+hm5M9h\njYjR71TxHihBMmkIEHwt6LPFUlNSUXCbmPuvlEEDyHR3YzMrCDdkWLWYkVQ3s5Dm\nUDZQRss5sCbGco