eads\nnothing from the local filesystem.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: validate filename and sourceUrl\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1875\n\n* fix: use asset.upload tag, only support https\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: lint, remove tmp dir from pnpm-workspace\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1875\n\n* fix: tests\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1875\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: squiggler-app[bot] <265501495+squiggler-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2afa3e7c07fd376c3feed334ac8b58f4f53084dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/trees/2afa3e7c07fd376c3feed334ac8b58f4f53084dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanity-io/cli/git/commits/ac3a20cd49b90d0abcdfed0f8dc8d472bbf3e783","verification":{"payload":"tree 2afa3e7c07fd376c3feed334ac8b58f4f53084dc\nparent 6d4a5f74c74f868112d4e1b3e86d2ba9fc8dd5d3\nauthor Matthew Ritter <matthew.ritter@sanity.io> 1789666697 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789666697 -0400\n\nfeat: media library url ingest (#1875)\n\n* feat(cli): import media library assets from a url\n\nmedia import now accepts an http(s) URL as its source argument and ingests\na single asset via POST /media-libraries/{id}/from-url, with repeatable\n--aspect key=value and --filename. Directory and archive imports are\nunchanged.\n\nExposes media:import to MCP for URL sources only, since a URL source reads\nnothing from the local filesystem.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: validate filename and sourceUrl\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1875\n\n* fix: use asset.upload tag, only support https\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: lint, remove tmp dir from pnpm-workspace\n\n* chore: update auto-generated changeset for PR #1875\n\n* fix: tests\n\n* chore: update auto-generated change