ogy` workspace to commit `f2265b8` for backstage `1.54.7` on branch `main`\n\n* fix(e2e): allow Red Hat PostgreSQL image for Helm deploy\n\nBitnami subchart in RHDH chart 2.0-90-CI rejects registry.redhat.io/rhel9/postgresql-15 unless global.security.allowInsecureImages is true.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): disable intelligentAssistant sidecar\n\nChart 2.0-90-CI defaults intelligentAssistant.enabled=true and starts lightspeed-core with --synthesized-config-output (CrashLoop). global.lightspeed.enabled is ignored.\n\n* Update `topology` workspace to commit `855b9cd` for backstage `1.54.7` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `topology` workspace to commit `741ec67` for backstage `1.54.7` on branch `main`\n\n* fix e2e tests\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.3.2\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* fix e2e tests\n\n* updated BS version\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.3.2\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n* fix e2e tests\n\nSigned-off-by: Debsmita Santra <debsmita.santra@gmail.com>\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.3.2\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Christoph Jerolimov <jerolimov+git@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Debsmita Santra <debsmita.santra@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Divyanshi Gupta <divyanshigupta3295@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e63ddb5f3ba32f51db10781f79a3a109e3b795a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/trees/4e63ddb5f3ba32f51db10781f79a3a109e3b795a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/commits/a07a8003be6190d8d985e6d0860a27efc8709fa5","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e63ddb5f3ba32f51db10781f79a3a109e3b795a\nparent fe8a5a8e8a0f6cf8d36a5b775279ceaebdf0290b\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791475830 +0530\ncommitte