istant dynamic-plugins.yaml\n\ntest-helper only selects dynamic-plugins-mcp.yaml or\ndynamic-plugins-nightly.yaml, so the non-MCP baseline was dead config.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): open MCP settings from the renamed menu item\n\nThe options menu item is \"MCP and Prompt Settings\", so the exact\n\"MCP settings\" locator timed out in e2e-ocp-helm.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Address jrichter1 review: remove unused saved-prompts helpers and rename drawer methods\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: HusneShabbir <husneshabbir447@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe0bb01f932b9ed3256ef68863876bcf2ad5c71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/trees/fe0bb01f932b9ed3256ef68863876bcf2ad5c71d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/commits/62d581882f6d252b96d57b96b8cccd4611645ee5","verification":{"payload":"tree fe0bb01f932b9ed3256ef68863876bcf2ad5c71d\nparent 1a06dfc5b1a485ec8c6a164fda43c09aaa0a2f5c\nauthor Husne Shabbir <shabbirhusne447@gmail.com> 1790860528 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790860528 +0200\n\nchore(e2e): add intelligent-assistant MCP coverage (#3408)\n\n* chore(e2e): add intelligent-assistant MCP coverage\n\nDeploy MCP plugins in the IA suite, skip notebook uploads for\nRHDHBUGS-3302, and disable Segment telemetry so tests do not send\noutbound analytics.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* chore(e2e): rebase and align MCP plugin OCI refs with main\n\nRebase onto main, drop obsolete versions.json/backstage override commits,\nupdate dynamic-plugins-mcp.yaml to bs_1.54.6 published tags, and add\nconfig cross-reference comments from review feedback.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* chore(e2e): remove unused intelligent-assistant dynamic-plugins.yaml\n\ntest-