reply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update `theme` workspace to commit `62625cc` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main` (#3864)\n\n* Update `theme` workspace to commit `8562380` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* chore: sync `versions.json` from `main`\n\n* fix(e2e): allow Red Hat PostgreSQL image for Helm deploy\n\nBitnami subchart in RHDH chart 2.0-90-CI rejects registry.redhat.io/rhel9/postgresql-15 unless global.security.allowInsecureImages is true.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): disable intelligentAssistant sidecar\n\nChart 2.0-90-CI defaults intelligentAssistant.enabled=true and starts lightspeed-core with --synthesized-config-output (CrashLoop). global.lightspeed.enabled is ignored.\n\n* Update `theme` workspace to commit `e316e3c` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `theme` workspace to commit `62625cc` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* update e2e\n\n* prettier fix\n\n* adjust locator\n\n* simplify test\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Christoph Jerolimov <jerolimov+git@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jan Richter <jrichter@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7b05914b6d909dc4bed57a0402168ba94b9106c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/trees/a7b05914b6d909dc4bed57a0402168ba94b9106c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/commits/178fd75e30169075b4ebff0d7c420bef641e4501","verification":{"payload":"tree a7b05914b6d909dc4bed57a0402168ba94b9106c\nparent bc6db78cbc31db3314225419c41220c441bcad51\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790855228 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790855228 -0300\n\nUpdate `theme` workspace to commit `62625cc` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main` (#3864)\n\n* Update `theme` workspace to commit `8562380` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* chore: sync `versions.json` from `main`\n\n* fix(e2e): allow Red Hat PostgreSQL image for Helm deploy\n\nBitnami subchart in RHDH chart 2.0-90-CI rejects registry.redhat.io/rhel9/postgresql-15 unless global.security.allowInsecureImages is true.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): disable intelligentAssistant sidecar\n\nChart 2.0-90-CI defaults intelligentAssistant.enabled=true and starts lightspeed-core with --synthesized-config-output (CrashLoop). global.lightspeed.enabled is ignored.\n\n* Update `theme` workspace to commit `e316e3c` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `theme` workspace to commit `62625cc` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* update e2e\n\n* prettier fix\n\n* adjust locator\n\n* simplify test\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Christoph Jerolimov <jerolimov+git@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jan Richter <jrichter@redhat.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvkg8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+RIQAACtyn9MZVyFWriJQjeERs+d\nA6EC5EBw0BQHYVh6zY15rRTfidwXNzEFrpgo79/eKdpjLUR/+6zkHfurN+QRYn2n\nqptaVl9H9Py7GizXyjqT1MsVRo9Ix39dY62goCrz6c/r3L7v3+ExV7M6ZjEQifB6\nT9dHLBd5d8gakmhY47gKGCneSfShYBeLPtLVUa166PPRwBJVJJIb1AbGMBgUppKw\nHr4eoMP11teiz8AMS93aP8vvJYf3uGjik2EHLLxLScxP+vpdV2MB6UTIwYbh/a40\nGCAq7ZLaZY8jUN0QQvv9/Re6pH2CctGa+S0UpE/AsBxk1ujB+xqtN07+F++HxklP\nXUaf5xEnsc9o8/QuR7c6vj36/mL0Gro7B3KS9oAAbPXcLz2g2a5frLHENoEIPyai\nCJXzuYu9g/zl15CoU7DrNf5fCz5DdyJR9kRCz/PVKY/Z4ojuC7pkNIcWxnzXHVBw\nnOYyaGFOMDVpSFdwnjYB5+n+vSt6kdf3P64tuhR2p/4+X/S3htzqFWKh58B2ar1a\nsvCMzl+i0544C7n4R++UIwZbMO5UVwGAEle8BOHlPCvlVmlsTbcOizMmg6JLH3zo\neOGeiR4muqmt4p721AXLrR/6lRYuplRFQFUXydgttShr5VEIZ/PXbQUf9s8O3bqh\ndT3q6AEFfk3gTrxIGJvX\n=Rt0o\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_a