ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/commits/a0d74e4be063eca348bb14deb1d116fcf1a6f922/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:00:35Z","email":"shabbirhusne447@gmail.com","name":"Husne Shabbir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:00:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(intelligent-assistant-e2e): saved prompts and screen context coverage (#4041)\n\n* test(intelligent-assistant-e2e): add saved prompts and screen context coverage\n\nPort basic live-cluster checks from rhdh-plugins IA e2e for create/apply/delete\nsaved prompts and enable/pause/fullscreen screen context flows.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(intelligent-assistant-e2e): recover catalog session in screen context\n\nUse gotoCatalogAuthenticated so a dropped Keycloak session after navigation\ndoes not leave the screen-context suite on the sign-in page.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(intelligent-assistant-e2e): include saved prompts and screen context specs\n\nPlaywright only runs files listed in testMatch, so the new specs were never\ncollected by CI.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(intelligent-assistant-e2e): check screen context in overlay and dock\n\nEnable the screen-context feature and drop the fullscreen case. The chip\nand Options toggle are only valid in overlay and dock-to-window.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(intelligent-assistant-e2e): recover from image pull and sidebar rename races\n\nRetry a failed RHDH deploy once so a transient lightspeed-core pull does not\nskip the Lightspeed file, and commit the notebook sidebar rename before the\ninput blurs closed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: HusneShabbir <husneshabbir447@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"c