mit `9e1fb5d` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `176f0fc` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `71ba108` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `353faac` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* fix(e2e): drop allowInsecureImages override per review feedback\n\nRemove the global.security.allowInsecureImages Helm value that is no\nlonger needed with chart 2.0-91-CI+ / 2.1-*-CI — the midstream commit\nthat required it has been reverted.\n\nAddresses review by @rm3l on #3897.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Christoph Jerolimov <jerolimov+git@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: fullsend-fix <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc7bccb4d48b90186860e380c01ad0c1a949571a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/trees/cc7bccb4d48b90186860e380c01ad0c1a949571a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/commits/f4dc37fbb1240ac550288cdb8ee8b2e9e8a24918","verification":{"payload":"tree cc7bccb4d48b90186860e380c01ad0c1a949571a\nparent 61367c5d02805ecbd91c4296191d8657a0780b8d\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790802630 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790802630 -0400\n\nUpdate `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `353faac` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main` (#3897)\n\n* Update `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `495a084` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* fix(e2e): allow Red Hat PostgreSQL image for Helm deploy\n\nBitnami subchart in RHDH chart 2.0-90-CI rejects registry.redhat.io/rhel9/postgresql-15 unless global.security.allowInsecureImages is true.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `9e1fb5d` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `176f0fc` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `71ba108` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* Update `intelligent-assistant` workspace to commit `353faac` for backstage `1.54.6` on branch `main`\n\n* fix(e2e): drop allowInsecureImages override per review feedback\n\nRemove the global.security.allowInsecureImages Helm value that is no\nlonger needed with chart 2.0-91-CI+ / 2.1-*-CI — the midstream commit\nthat required it has been reverted.\n\nAddresses review by @rm3l on #3897.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Christoph Jerolimov <jerolimov+git@redhat.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: fullsend-fix <278716306+fullsend-ai-coder[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvXrGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf6MQAGYQVUa8dfylv8CtweGCK57z\nsPAMZxWILgTbkmulYbSRNn/QGjMoQet646/uCcu1qAmCesysONqUw8Y/qhsCIwL/\nJDdsfhiJk5CjPrbOlWI6itJTWq/J8+rKMwT8XNYUV7XdT8wrF61FuEK6RhLz+xGi\nmra3zEH5rCGBE47DHSR5jFsVD8BOFu8ywLR3F2m4VMEpaY6dUZ+Wc17Lz1m4Z77a\n8iN1DbrxgJWsXtgbmXR9FgP5IvFWWW1Bcyf+zHyWicV0+j9GiF+l1adD/ARy8e1Z\nhFcCv/hBNomUByCz//PgFpyzJyA0fMPg4upURBvBdOQzisD5/HXoUY6elKMbzmFb\nGg2LNQm9fXJ0vQdNxPeMds0MbjNCFxO6k+HT9TQZ+hm1gU9crG5copHbEFhmSomO\nIg6rUhR4flwKiGSaEyXuTig6PFWBbFdZ4eVTX1psRrRsaFyLCFDPfEsWnrQUBR+k\nvEr6x2uhwUn+ooXj0npefKBOQwKFkf17BlhlJHomTZe9L0M84hKRzDUMm3sfToRL\nIZp7CpkCeClBkQ8eptBzVs4Q4YUL9zdoQFLv