r_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152174275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HusneShabbir","id":152174275,"login":"HusneShabbir","node_id":"U_kgDOCRH-ww","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HusneShabbir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/commits/a4101f07978db66302e7fb4b1c21d38e9a703660/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:57:58Z","email":"shabbirhusne447@gmail.com","name":"Husne Shabbir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:57:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): target chart 2.1 ia-stack ConfigMap (#4014)\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): target chart 2.1 ia-stack ConfigMap\n\nRHDH chart 2.1+ creates redhat-developer-hub-ia-stack (lightspeed-stack.yaml)\ninstead of redhat-developer-hub-lightspeed-config (config.yaml). Update\npatchOpenAiAllowedModels for the rebranded name and LCORE 0.7 provider shape.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): satisfy naming-convention for LCORE YAML keys\n\nUse bracket notation for snake_case stack fields so ESLint\n@typescript-eslint/naming-convention passes in E2E Code Quality.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): harden IA chat session and history locators\n\nRecover Keycloak SSO after reload/goto without assuming a popup, fix chat\nrow rename/select hit targets, and skip auto-delete until RHDHBUGS-3838.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* style(intelligent-assistant-e2e): format test-helper with Prettier\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): address review on session helpers\n\nUse oc wait for Ready backstage pods, drop unnecessary isVisible().catch,\nand reuse LoginHelper.loginAsKeycloakUser for mid-suite re-auth.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): restore SSO-safe mid-suite re-auth\n\nloginAsKeycloakUser always goto(''/'') and waits for a popup; after reload\nSign In often completes in-page via SSO, which hung CI and left Home with\nIA closed. Race popup vs SSO on the current page and reopen the chat drawer.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: HusneShabbir <husneshabbir447@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c30040cc9de1e7cf4f85cd5b2157cb44558db08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/trees/7c30040cc9de1e7cf4f85cd5b2157cb44558db08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redhat-developer/rhdh-plugin-export-overlays/git/commits/a4101f07978db66302e7fb4b1c21d38e9a703660","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c30040cc9de1e7cf4f85cd5b2157cb44558db08\nparent b237f68f6803b97ca5a251d9d5c992d2080c320d\nauthor Husne Shabbir <shabbirhusne447@gmail.com> 1790791078 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790791078 +0530\n\nfix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): target chart 2.1 ia-stack ConfigMap (#4014)\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): target chart 2.1 ia-stack ConfigMap\n\nRHDH chart 2.1+ creates redhat-developer-hub-ia-stack (lightspeed-stack.yaml)\ninstead of redhat-developer-hub-lightspeed-config (config.yaml). Update\npatchOpenAiAllowedModels for the rebranded name and LCORE 0.7 provider shape.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): satisfy naming-convention for LCORE YAML keys\n\nUse bracket notation for snake_case stack fields so ESLint\n@typescript-eslint/naming-convention passes in E2E Code Quality.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): harden IA chat session and history locators\n\nRecover Keycloak SSO after reload/goto without assuming a popup, fix chat\nrow rename/select hit targets, and skip auto-delete until RHDHBUGS-3838.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* style(intelligent-assistant-e2e): format test-helper with Prettier\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): address review on session helpers\n\nUse oc wait for Ready backstage pods, drop unnecessary isVisible().catch,\nand reuse LoginHelper.loginAsKeycloakUser for mid-suite re-auth.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(intelligent-assistant-e2e): restore SSO-safe mid-suite re-auth\n\nloginAsKeycloakUser always goto(''/'') and waits for a popup; after reload\nSign In often completes in-page via SSO, which hung CI and left Home with\nIA closed. Race popup vs SSO on the current page and reopen the chat drawer.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: HusneShabbir <husneshabbir447@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvU2mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAc/8QABfupLIVWC1tRgpOU6JQWOXd\nmWQZaaBIvj8skmoL/Pb2eayYkuZgFSvlHtG8+4Lqd0Eme7NOjFgFpR3oAHz/0RoX\nXZMrTw7/rFLtRJ6AyrW/8+kmtsaSVRIqCnFJa1VuL8F4rHsYEx8R2VDcnauMtfat\ngfd5xJH1J2QwOwdq5vSE99UibI1ahn0GAXSuizQFAXXh7Q2EDEKMIbp/soRiQyyg\n/NfL6OdUIwgPktJ68mXqOjG3x1KN/MvRVsEKv1NKit4xBI7L2e0rnC8ogWKhBmkK\nR