er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cvkline","id":6576592,"login":"cvkline","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzY1OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cvkline","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/497b90eae159a7ceefb1ea66b55302a3c7f54b5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T18:12:32Z","email":"ckline@instructure.com","name":"Charley Kline"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T19:03:03Z","email":"ckline@instructure.com","name":"Charley Kline"},"message":"Remove Zod strictObject()\n\nOur API contract allows us to ADD things to JSONs returned\nby REST calls... but some places use Zod in \"strict\" mode,\nwhich throws an error if \"unexpected\" fields are present in\nthe returned JSON. This means that this code is not adhering\nto our own API contract. This removes the uses of strictObject.\n\nTest plan:\n* automated tests pass\n\nChange-Id: If62a39516062d446d0c19f8b8895657dc8aebd5b\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/415182\nReviewed-by: Maya Tyner <maya.tyner@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Charley Kline <ckline@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Charley Kline <ckline@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"b34c2951f0f852000b7236e6c34507421350781c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/b34c2951f0f852000b7236e6c34507421350781c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/497b90eae159a7ceefb1ea66b5