c.rb\n- rspec spec/controllers/lti/lti_apps_controller_spec.rb\n- rspec spec/controllers/lti/token_controller_spec.rb\n\ncloses QE-96\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nChange-Id: I85595d5779bab2e0f2b8c06a3dc9c891481aa0a7\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/414452\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Robin Kuss <rkuss@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Danhong Chen <danhong.chen@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Danhong Chen <danhong.chen@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"25440c765c854d75a1be2fa7711fdc49b4c53130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/25440c765c854d75a1be2fa7711fdc49b4c53130"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/f6986dd290cb1f3cbbb7e02f5e3e2418c81bfafe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30183177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/danhong-chen","id":30183177,"login":"danhong-chen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTgzMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danhong-chen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/f6986dd290cb1f3cbbb7e02f5e3e2418c81bfafe","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKGY2OTg2ZGQyOTBjYjFmM2NiYmI3ZTAyZjVlM2UyNDE4YzgxYmZhZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/7dfb56b4e19e68f7f5cadcf3838f538c47df5e30","sha":"7dfb56b4e19e68f7f5cadcf3838f538c47df5e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/7dfb56b4e19e68f7f5cadcf3838f538c47df5e30"}],"sha":"f6986dd290cb1f3cbbb7e02f5e3e2418c81bfafe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/f6986dd290cb1f3cbbb7e02f5e3e2418c81bfafe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42885142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hawkbawk","id":42885142,"login":"Hawkbawk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODg1MTQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hawkbawk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/7dfb56b4e19e68f7f5cadcf3838f538c47df5e30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T21:02:10Z","email":"ryan.hawkins@instructure.com","name":"Ryan Hawkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T15:08:36Z","email":"paul.gray@instructure.com","name":"Paul Gray"},"message":"Expire existing non-admin tokens to July 18\n\nwhy:\n- We want to reduce how long non-account admin access tokens live, to\n  reduce possible leakage blast radius.\n- New tokens already have a maximum lifetime of 30 days. These\n  migrations bring old tokens in line with the new enforcements.\n\ncloses INTEROP-10663\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- seed a non-admin user with a token that never expires or expires after\n  2026-07-18\n- run the migrations & jobs\n- verify the token''s expiration is now 2026-07-18\n- verify account admins'' tokens are untouched\n\nChange-Id: I11ab506102d168551738f8b7db30e865efb5487f\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/413857\nMigration-Review: Isaac Moore <isaac.moore@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Xander Moffatt <xmoffatt@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b5ad11b4763f9f8cc0aec6b16d8ef484e714c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/3b5ad11b4763f9f8cc0aec6b16d8ef484e714c74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/7dfb56b4e19e68f7f5cadcf3838f538c47df5e30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4752550?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pfgray","id":4752550,"login":"pfgray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTI1NTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/7dfb56b4e19e68f7f5cadcf3838f538c47df5e30","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKDdkZmI1NmI0ZTE5ZTY4ZjdmNWNhZGNmMzgzOGY1MzhjNDdkZjVlMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/e15c7c8acae3b5a66108e9d002cac5db6dbe6762","sha":"e15c7c8acae3b5a66108e9d002cac5db6dbe6762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/e15c7c8acae3b5a66108e9d002cac5db6dbe6762"}],"sha":"7dfb56b4e19e68f7f5cadcf3838f538c47df5e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/7dfb56b4e19e68f7f5cadcf3838f538c47df5e30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79874817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hossamg-122","id":79874817,"login":"hossamg-122","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5ODc0ODE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/e15c7c8acae3b5a66108e9d002cac5db6dbe6762/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T07:14:09Z","email":"hossam.ebrahim@instructure.com","name":"hossamg122"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:36:26Z","email":"hossam.ebrahim@instructure.com","name":"Hossam Ebrahim"},"message":"Fix pass/fail grade display under RQD\n\nOn the student grades page, a 0-point complete/incomplete\nassignment was routed through the zero-point quantitative\nhandler when Restrict Quantitative Data was enabled, which\nreturns a checkmark for any score of 0. Since incomplete\nstores a score of 0, it wrongly showed as complete.\n\nPass/fail is qualitative, so skip the RQD letter-grade path\nand read the grade string (score is 0 for both complete and\nincomplete at 0 points).\n\nfixes EVAL-6116\nflag=restrict_quantitative_data\n\ntest plan:\n- enable Restrict view of quantitative data on a course\n- add a 0-point complete/incomplete assignment\n- mark a student incomplete\n- as the student, the grades page shows incomplete (x)\n- mark complete; it shows complete (check)\n\nChange-Id: Ic7d8cae6aaadc669f8cecb4cbf790079171858fb\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/413468\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Rajmund Csehil <rajmund.csehil@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Rajmund Csehil <rajmund.csehil@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Kai Bjorkman <kbjorkman@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Spencer Olson <solson@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Yasi Afsharnive <yasaman.afsharnive@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"16947b035ad78e8cc5cf92bf92851679bdcb8b0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/16947b035ad78e8cc5cf92bf92851679bdcb8b0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/e15c7c8acae3b5a66108e9d002cac5db6dbe6762","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79874817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hossamg-122","id":79874817,"login":"hossamg-122","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5ODc0ODE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hossamg-122","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/e15c7c8acae3b5a66108e9d002cac5db6dbe6762","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKGUxNWM3YzhhY2FlM2I1YTY2MTA4ZTlkMDAyY2FjNWRiNmRiZTY3NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/0eef79b1a02b1ddd8532eb604191c5b718c8c19e","sha":"0eef79b1a02b1ddd8532eb604191c5b718c8c19e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/0eef79b1a02b1ddd8532eb604191c5b718c8c19e"}],"sha":"e15c7c8acae3b5a66108e9d002cac5db6dbe6762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/e15c7c8acae3b5a66108e9d002cac5db6dbe6762"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6128215?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/westonkd","id":6128215,"login":"westonkd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjgyMTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/0eef79b1a02b1ddd8532eb604191c5b718c8c19e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T18:45:51Z","email":"wdransfield@instructure.com","name":"Weston Dransfield"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:23:39Z","email":"wdransfield@instructure.com","name":"Weston Dransfield"},"message":"Add platform tokens initializer\n\ncloses INTEROP-10654\nflag=none\n\nTest Plan:\n- A clean boot of the application runs without error\n\nChange-Id: If60e6a71a0429335e36fef3b7dabcd8a8172a086\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/413837\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: David Varga <d.varga@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: David Varga <d.varga@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Weston Dransfield <wdransfield@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0b67c19a3db7053afcbd98c511a47faa901bd4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/e0b67c19a3db7053afcbd98c511a47faa901bd4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/0eef79b1a02b1ddd8532eb604191c5b718c8c19e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6128215?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/westonkd","id":6128215,"login":"westonkd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjgyMTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/westonkd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/0eef79b1a02b1ddd8532eb604191c5b718c8c19e","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKDBlZWY3OWIxYTAyYjFkZGQ4NTMyZWI2MDQxOTFjNWI3MThjOGMxOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/737074409251e2bea4d1da355d112bf1725baf9a","sha":"737074409251e2bea4d1da355d112bf1725baf9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/737074409251e2bea4d1da355d112bf1725baf9a"}],"sha":"0eef79b1a02b1ddd8532eb604191c5b718c8c19e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/0eef79b1a02b1ddd8532eb604191c5b718c8c19e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4752550?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pfgray","id":4752550,"login":"pfgray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTI1NTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/737074409251e2bea4d1da355d112bf1725baf9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T20:26:51Z","email":"paul.gray@instructure.com","name":"Paul Gray"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:10:46Z","email":"paul.gray@instructure.com","name":"Paul Gray"},"message":"Add presentation options in Dynamic Registration\n\nThe Dynamic Registration standard was recently updated to add support\nfor \"presentation options\"\n(https://github.com/1EdTech/LTI-central/pull/518/changes)\nfor message handlers.\n\nThis commit adds support for presentation options in the Dynamic\nRegistration implementation.\n\nThis change now allows tools to specify the width and height of the\niframes used to launch their tool, like:\n\n```json\n{\n  ...\n  \"https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/lti-tool-configuration\": {\n    ...\n    \"messages\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"LtiDeepLinkingRequest\",\n        \"placements\": [\"RichTextEditor\"],\n        \"target_link_uri\": \"https://client.example.org/lti/dl\",\n        \"label\": \"Add a virtual garden\",\n        \"iframe\": {\n           \"width\": 1024,\n           \"height\": 800\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\ntest plan:\n1. Install yaltt via dynamic registration\n3. Specify a width and height for the iframe in the tool configuration\n  (use the custom JSON option in the yaltt tool configuration for this).\n4. Launch the tool from the RichTextEditor placement and verify that the\n iframe is sized according to the specified width and height (within\n the constraints that Canvas has set).\n5. You can also verify the heights/widths using the /launch_definitions\n endpoint\n\ncloses INTEROP-10748\n\nChange-Id: Ifec9dc6976330d7e491cfa2f610fd7ff5964be56\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/414434\nReviewed-by: Xander Moffatt <xmoffatt@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Steven McGee <steve.mcgee@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Xander Moffatt <xmoffatt@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"52a262adc30f62d54657e1bf02e76b9d0d806405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/52a262adc30f62d54657e1bf02e76b9d0d806405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/737074409251e2bea4d1da355d112bf1725baf9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4752550?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pfgray","id":4752550,"login":"pfgray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTI1NTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pfgray","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/737074409251e2bea4d1da355d112bf1725baf9a","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKDczNzA3NDQwOTI1MWUyYmVhNGQxZGEzNTVkMTEyYmYxNzI1YmFmOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/747be02eab64022a66ea2bad0457f7c1f8e428b4","sha":"747be02eab64022a66ea2bad0457f7c1f8e428b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/747be02eab64022a66ea2bad0457f7c1f8e428b4"}],"sha":"737074409251e2bea4d1da355d112bf1725baf9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/737074409251e2bea4d1da355d112bf1725baf9a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/747be02eab64022a66ea2bad0457f7c1f8e428b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T14:52:15Z","email":"mahema.singh@instructure.com","name":"Mahema Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T13:51:00Z","email":"mahema.singh@instructure.com","name":"Mahema Singh"},"message":"Fix LTI 1.1 iframe size in A2 student view\n\nWhen A2 (Assignments Enhancements - Students) is enabled,\nthe iframe for LTI 1.1 external tool assignments was\ndisplaying at the default size instead of honoring the\ntool''s configured selection_width/selection_height.\n\nEGG-749 fixed this for LTI 1.3 tools by reading top-level\ntool settings. LTI 1.1 tools store per-assignment\ndimensions in external_tool_tag.link_settings instead,\nwhich the A2 controller path never read.\n\nThe fix mirrors the resolution order used by the classic\n(non-A2) tool_dimensions path: link_settings takes\npriority, falling back to top-level tool settings.\n\nfixes EGG-1158\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\nSetup:\n- Enable Assignments Enhancements - Students FF\n- Configure a LTI 1.1 external tool on an assignment\n  with selection_width and selection_height set via\n  link_settings (e.g. 500x400)\n\nTesting:\n- View the assignment as a student\n- Verify the tool iframe renders at 500x400, not at\n  the default ~1078x450 size\n- Disable the FF and verify the classic view also\n  sizes correctly (no regression)\n- Repeat with a LTI 1.3 tool and verify it still\n  sizes correctly (existing behavior preserved)\n\nChange-Id: I20cd851a2554c26e9b163f432fffe90abaf58230\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/414717\nReviewed-by: Jason Gillett <jason.gillett@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jason Gillett <jason.gillett@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Kyle Rosenbaum <krosenbaum@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"eaca07ee6596e84656654b5b3194b26a09289237","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/eaca07ee6596e84656654b5b3194b26a09289237"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/747be02eab64022a66ea2bad0457f7c1f8e428b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/747be02eab64022a66ea2bad0457f7c1f8e428b4","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKDc0N2JlMDJlYWI2NDAyMmE2NmVhMmJhZDA0NTdmN2MxZjhlNDI4YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/d4d754c674e0fdb490a441706174b6e090d1dad7","sha":"d4d754c674e0fdb490a441706174b6e090d1dad7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/d4d754c674e0fdb490a441706174b6e090d1dad7"}],"sha":"747be02eab64022a66ea2bad0457f7c1f8e428b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/747be02eab64022a66ea2bad0457f7c1f8e428b4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/d4d754c674e0fdb490a441706174b6e090d1dad7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T13:48:19Z","email":"svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com","name":"Jenkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T13:48:30Z","email":"svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com","name":"Service Cloud Jenkins"},"message":"update ko translation\n\nChange-Id: I9b383ca739b6ef02b287f7f41551f33f4fe4757a\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/415119\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"781aa4297d57d8f976d6635ad1f2065a72890308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/781aa4297d57d8f976d6635ad1f2065a72890308"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/d4d754c674e0fdb490a441706174b6e090d1dad7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/d4d754c674e0fdb490a441706174b6e090d1dad7","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKGQ0ZDc1NGM2NzRlMGZkYjQ5MGE0NDE3MDYxNzRiNmUwOTBkMWRhZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/d28796e9aeeac756ee1199bd2c92451bccf0cd05","sha":"d28796e9aeeac756ee1199bd2c92451bccf0cd05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/d28796e9aeeac756ee1199bd2c92451bccf0cd05"}],"sha":"d4d754c674e0fdb490a441706174b6e090d1dad7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/d4d754c674e0fdb490a441706174b6e090d1dad7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33700893?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelagomba","id":33700893,"login":"angelagomba","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzAwODkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/d28796e9aeeac756ee1199bd2c92451bccf0cd05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T13:06:25Z","email":"angela.gomba@instructure.com","name":"Angela Gomba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T13:44:43Z","email":"angela.gomba@instructure.com","name":"Angela Gomba"},"message":"Show full status for section-limited students\n\nA section-limited student saw only their own\nsection''s members, so a full self-signup group\nlooked joinable. Send the true full state and\nuse it to lock the group.\n\nfixes EGG-2202\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- as a teacher, make a self-signup group set\n  with a membership cap\n- in a course with 2+ sections, set students to\n  section-limited privileges\n- fill a group with students from each section\n  until it reaches the cap\n- as a section-limited student not in a group,\n  open the course Groups page\n- verify the full group shows the lock/\"Group is\n  full\" state and no Join button\n\nChange-Id: Id27b04377ab6af8242d00d8544e5c853a9e609e3\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/414718\nReviewed-by: Jason Gillett <jason.gillett@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Chrystal Langston <chrystal.langston@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Kyle Rosenbaum <krosenbaum@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"af1c3c2f83f127cdad182c772e33be60a5f034c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/af1c3c2f83f127cdad182c772e33be60a5f034c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/d28796e9aeeac756ee1199bd2c92451bccf0cd05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33700893?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelagomba","id":33700893,"login":"angelagomba","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzAwODkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/d28796e9aeeac756ee1199bd2c92451bccf0cd05","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKGQyODc5NmU5YWVlYWM3NTZlZTExOTliZDJjOTI0NTFiY2NmMGNkMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/1c7dc6447be47c3849e708c517028eba0b2bf65e","sha":"1c7dc6447be47c3849e708c517028eba0b2bf65e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/1c7dc6447be47c3849e708c517028eba0b2bf65e"}],"sha":"d28796e9aeeac756ee1199bd2c92451bccf0cd05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/d28796e9aeeac756ee1199bd2c92451bccf0cd05"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/1c7dc6447be47c3849e708c517028eba0b2bf65e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T13:35:02Z","email":"svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com","name":"Jenkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T13:35:11Z","email":"svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com","name":"Service Cloud Jenkins"},"message":"update ko translation\n\nChange-Id: Ie481e04f6d1d80da39f2dbd270f98806b9de8108\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/415117\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"acf32dbf2930eba117111bf9101d8c1869a2ace0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/trees/acf32dbf2930eba117111bf9101d8c1869a2ace0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/git/commits/1c7dc6447be47c3849e708c517028eba0b2bf65e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/1c7dc6447be47c3849e708c517028eba0b2bf65e","node_id":"C_kwDONrXK9toAKDFjN2RjNjQ0N2JlNDdjMzg0OWU3MDhjNTE3MDI4ZWJhMGIyYmY2NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commit/fcf63f51f3f4a38f76ea573bdbb78b9a90f13051","sha":"fcf63f51f3f4a38f76ea573bdbb78b9a90f13051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/fcf63f51f3f4a38f76ea573bdbb78b9a90f13051"}],"sha":"1c7dc6447be47c3849e708c517028eba0b2bf65e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/1c7dc6447be47c3849e708c517028eba0b2bf65e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20050280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xandroxygen","id":20050280,"login":"xandroxygen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDUwMjgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaronshaf/canvas-lms/commits/fcf63f51f3f4a38f76ea573bdbb78b9a90f13051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T18:41:25Z","email":"xmoffatt@instructure.com","name":"Xander Moffatt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T12:56:22Z","email":"steve.mcgee@instructure.com","name":"Steven McGee"},"message":"Scope site-admin OAuth tokens to root account\n\nA site-admin token created via the OAuth flow on one Canvas instance\nwas usable on all other instances sharing that dev key. Stamp tokens\nissued to site-admin users with the scoped_to_root_account_id of the\norigin account, and reject requests where the token''s account doesn''t\nmatch the incoming domain.\n\nEnforcement is gated behind the oauth_token_account_scoping feature\nflag. The stamp is always written regardless of flag state so Datadog\nmetrics can surface cross-account usage before the flag is enabled in\nproduction. The Datadog events to be captured are gated by the\noauth_token_scope_mismatch_events flag so we can enable/disable\nindependent of the enforcement flag.\n\nfixes INTEROP-10592\nflag=oauth_token_account_scoping\nflag=oauth_token_scope_mismatch_events\n\ntest plan:\n- Be sure to run db:migrate to apply the two predeploy migrations\n- As a site-admin user, complete the OAuth flow (authorize + accept)\n  on your local canvas instance.\n- Exchange the code for a token\n- Confirm the token works on your local canvas instance.\n- Use that same token against a different Canvas instance and confirm\n  it is rejected with a 401\n- Verify older tokens (without scoped_to_root_account_id) still work\n  on any instance unaffected\n- Disable the oauth_token_account_scoping feature flag for a specific\n  account and confirm the restriction is lifted for that account only\n\nChange-Id: Ida1afd92c2d44ac52571a6276078cd95e7ac88d4\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/408833\nMigration-Review: Cody Cutrer <cody@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Xander Moffatt <xmoffatt@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Xander Moffatt <xmoffatt@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Xander Moffatt <xmoffatt@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: David Varga <d.varga@instructure.com>","tre